<HOME>"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_3","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"sed -n '241,520p' skills/goai-survey-writer/SKILL.md\"","aggregated_output":"   中化学式/多大写缩写（BaZn2Si2O7、COF、LLZO…）加 `{}` 保护，\n   防止 plainnat 压成 `bazn 2 si 2 o 7` 碎片。\n2. 一致性闸门（未定义 key＝阻塞；库内条目整合率 <90%＝阻塞——孤儿条目\n   要么在正文找到落点，要么开 issue 交 lit_search 评估后移出库，\n   不许留着充数）：\n\n   ```\n   python3 tools/bib_guard.py workspace/drafts/sections \\\n       workspace/library/references.bib --min-integration 0.9 --min-cites-per-1k 8\n   ```\n\n3. 自精修一轮（halt rules）：只修 clarity/流畅/重复，\n   **不许**为讨好审稿删数据、删 limitation、改结论强度；每处改动在\n   `workspace/drafts/revision_log.md` 留一行。拿不准是否更好的修改，\n   在 revision_log 保留原文并标 `[REVERT-CANDIDATE]`，交 review 轮裁决；\n   精修后必须复跑一致性闸门，引用密度或整合率较精修前下降即回滚该处修改。\n   **语言自然度专项**（拗口是最常见的失败模式，两种语言都查）：\n   - 逐段做朗读测试：一口气读不顺、定语连环套、一句超过 40 词/60 字\n     的拆句重写；\n   - 英文稿禁中式英语（逐字直译的搭配、\"research(es)\" 滥用、名词化\n     堆叠 the utilization of…），动词优先、主语就近；\n   - 中文稿禁翻译腔（\"被\"字滥用、\"进行了…的研究\"、\"对于…而言\"空转、\n     欧化长定语），改短句与主动语态；\n   - 每节抽 2 段与 style_bank 写作卡的句式模式对照，偏离领域惯用\n     表达的改写；super_library lint 报告里的 wording 项逐条处理。\n4. 组稿完整性闸门：`python3 tools/tex_guard.py workspace/drafts` ——\n   阻塞项：TODO 占位残留（模板的标题/作者/摘要必须已替换）、`\\input` 与\n   图文件存在、`\\ref` 无悬空、环境与花括号闭合、**裸 BibTeX key 泄漏到\n   正文**（含与汉字紧贴的 key；确属同形词可在行尾注释\n   `% tex-guard: allow-key` 豁免）；告警项：`\\texttt` 密度过高、中文稿\n   套英文模板。任一阻塞项不得记 `draft_complete`，告警项逐条处理或在\n   revision_log 说明原因。有 latex 环境则再编译验证（中文稿 xelatex；\n   图一律先 `drawio_export` 出 pdf 再 `\\includegraphics`，不依赖\n   `\\includesvg`），编译告警逐条处理；编译后 `pdftoppm` 抽首页、\n   一张表所在页、参考文献页各看一眼——标签语言、表格完整性、文献条目\n   有无被压小写的化学式，这三处是制作质量事故的高发区。\n   另外，`academic_language_guard.py` 必须通过，确保内部控制语言没有泄漏\n   到正文、表格和图注。\n5. `loopctl gate --name draft_complete --status PASS\n   --inputs workspace/drafts/main.tex,workspace/library/references.bib`\n   并交 review。\n\n## 返工协议\n\n收到 reviewer 的 issue（账本里 target=writing）：逐条修，修完\n`loopctl issue close --id <I?> --note \"<改了什么>\"`；不同意的意见要在\nrevision_log 里写反驳理由并保留原文，交由下轮 review 仲裁，不许静默忽略。\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
<HOME>"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_2","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"wc -l skills/goai-figure-studio/SKILL.md && sed -n '1,240p' skills/goai-figure-studio/SKILL.md\"","aggregated_output":"237 skills/goai-figure-studio/SKILL.md\n---\nname: goai-figure-studio\ndescription: Use when the survey needs publication-quality figures — 画图 agent：顶会级主图走「策略合同 → AI 生图两轮候选 → 可编辑化重建」三段管线，辅助图走 figspec 直渲；产物恒为 svg+drawio 可编辑双格式。触发词：「画图」「框架图」「taxonomy 图」「figure」。\n---\n\n# GoAI Figure-Studio —— 论文图纸 agent\n\n方法论四支柱（image-first 流程）：\n**源忠实、edge-label-first、模块化不碎片化、克制配色**。\n执行形态是**自动化回环**：不等人逐步确认，候选生成与审计全自动收敛，\n人只看最终产物。工具来自 MCP server `goai-figure`。\n\n**image-first 是默认路径**：凡进论文的图，一律先用 AI 生图拿视觉参照、\n再按参照做可编辑化重建（figspec → svg + drawio）。生图可用于探索构图、\n晶体/材料纹理和抽象结构意象；但生图模型生成的文字、化学式、数值和箭头\n不具有证据效力，必须在重建阶段由 SVG/Draw.io 原生图元确定性补回。必要时，\n可将经审查的生图作为 Draw.io 中的锁定底图或图像图层，再叠加原生文字、节点、\n曲线和连接器。**生图本身永远不是论文交付物**。直接手写 figspec 只在无生图\n通道时作为降级路径，且必须 `loopctl log --event decision` 记录降级原因。\n\n## 图纸分级（先分级再动手）\n\n| 级别 | 适用 | 管线 |\n|---|---|---|\n| **主图** | taxonomy 总览、框架/机制图、领域地图（读者记住综述靠它） | 三段式：A 策略合同 → B AI 生图两轮候选（4+2） → C 可编辑化重建 |\n| **标准图** | **行文路线图（每篇综述必配）**、时间线、多模块流程 | A 策略合同 → B 单轮 2 候选 → C 可编辑化重建 |\n| **辅助图** | 简单示意、统计小图 | A 策略合同 → 单轮 1 参照图 → figspec 重建（无通道时直渲） |\n\n对比矩阵优先建议用表格，不硬画。宿主无生图通道时降级 figspec 直渲，\n记账说明。**行文路线图**（本文组织结构：各节回答什么问题、怎么推进）\n是综述标配，writer 蓝图登记后由本 skill 按标准图管线出图。\n\n## Phase A：策略与合同（每图必做，写进 workspace/notes/figure_plan.md）\n\n### A1 三问定生死\n\n- **reader question**：读者看这张图要回答什么问题？\n- **visual mainline**：视觉主线（方法流/分类层级/时间演进）？数据流当主线\n  仅当综述对象本身是数据/检索/管线。\n- **来源锚点**：图上每个模块/箭头对应库内哪些文献或 taxonomy 哪个节点？\n\n### A2 图纸合同（prompt contract，违反即返工）\n\n- **源忠实表**：逐行列出可见模块/边/符号/关键标签，每行标 `direct`（库内\n  文献或 taxonomy 直接支撑）、`inferred`（严格推得，写明前提与推理链）、\n  `remove`/`revise`；有未处理的 remove/revise 不得进入 B/C。\n  「画起来顺」「常见画法」不算证据。\n- **边证据账**：每条边能指出上下游端点含义的证据；不画装饰性箭头、\n  不画假中继（A 产 x、C 用 x、B 不消费 x，则禁止 A→B 标 x）。\n- **edge-label-first**：变量/指标/权重放边 label，不做同级盒子。\n- **捆绑连线**：两模块间默认一条线；只有各自携带不同标注量时才许平行\n  多线；每种线型在同图内只允许一个含义。\n- **核心模块非空盒**：核心方法族模块要画出可见内部机制（步骤 token/\n  判定门/fork-merge/轻量反馈环），保持「输入→操作→输出」最小链，\n  不省掉操作、也不膨胀成第二张算法图。\n- **符号一一对应**：同一符号/颜色不表示两个概念，反之亦然。\n- **重复实体压缩**：重复家族默认压缩成标记（chips/branch），\n  不复制整条流水线。\n- **模糊指令规范化**：上游给的模糊视觉指令（「体现方法差异」）先翻译成\n  具体含义/安全画法/禁止的误实现，翻译不出来退回提问。\n- **可见文字白名单**：本图允许出现的全部文字，用词与 taxonomy/正文一致。\n- **学科用语约束**：图面、图例和图注使用材料学中的相组成、结构关系、\n  合成条件和表征方法；不得把 agent 内部的“过闸、标签、字段、端点、\n  工具箱、降权”等控制术语作为可见文字。优先写“目标化合物直接报道、\n  相关结构体系、实验条件、互补表征和可外推范围”等学术表达。\n- **配色合同（学术克制是硬约束，花哨即返工）**：优先采用\n  `workspace/style_bank/figure_style_cards.md` 的领域配色基准；无风格库\n  时一主一辅 + 灰阶可读。顶刊学术图的基线是：白/浅灰卡片底 + 中饱和\n  描边 + **全图至多 2 个主题色**（其余信息用灰阶与线型区分）、强调色\n  只给 1 个焦点元素；大面积彩色 lane 平铺、每个分组一种鲜艳底色的\n  「彩虹泳道」都算花哨，改用浅灰分区 + 描边区分。**禁**：AI 蓝紫渐变、\n  霓虹饱和、玻璃球高光、bokeh、营销海报打光、装饰性色带。自查基准：\n  与 style_bank 范图并排对照，若明显比范图鲜艳/花哨即违反合同。\n- **密度预算**：主内容占画面中心，模块数落在风格卡舒适区间；\n  大片空白、微块散射、头重脚轻的背景横幅都是阻塞项。\n\n## Phase B：AI 生图候选（主图两轮 4+2；标准图单轮 2；辅助图单轮 1）\n\n生图路由：Codex 宿主用 `image_gen`；Cursor 宿主用 GenerateImage 工具；\n均无 → 降级 figspec 直渲并记账。风格参照：prompt 附\n`workspace/style_bank/exemplar_figures/` 的范图路径（支持 reference image\n的通道传入；不支持则在 prompt 里文字化描述风格卡要点）。\n标准图/辅助图走本节的裁剪版：跳过 B1 的 4 候选探索，直接按 A2 合同写\nprompt 生成 2/1 张参照，过一遍 B2 审计要点后进 Phase C。\n\n### B1 第一轮：4 候选草图探索\n\n- 基于 A2 合同写 4 份 prompt（同一语义骨架 × 不同叙事/布局组合：\n  如横向流水线/纵向层级/中心辐射/分区地图），每份 prompt 内嵌\n  合同硬约束块（源忠实清单、edge-label-first、配色合同、密度预算、\n  文字白名单——生图模型渲染文字不可靠，白名单文字要求「位置留槽、\n  拼写尽力」，最终以 Phase C 重建版为准）。\n- 逐一生图得 `workspace/figures/candidates/<fig>/c01-c04.png`。\n\n### B2 自动审计与方向选择（issue-ledger 式，不跳过）\n\n- 用 Read 逐张审图，对照 A2 合同记 issue ledger（写入 figure_plan.md）：\n  变量画成盒子？装饰箭头/假中继？同义平行线？核心模块空盒？主线偏心？\n  密度失衡？AI 味配色？与源忠实表冲突的结构？\n- 按「合同违反数 + 主线清晰度 + 风格卡贴合度」选出方向候选 1 张，\n  并列出它要修的 issue 与要保留的视觉精华。\n\n### B3 第二轮：2 正式候选\n\n- 以胜出方向为主线重写 2 份 prompt（携带其视觉精华 + 逐条修复 B2 issue\n  + 支持通道时附胜出草图为 reference image），生成\n  `f01.png / f02.png`。生图模型对**箭头方向类指令不可靠**（实测明示\n  方向仍被反转）：方向敏感边在两份 prompt 里用不同 routing 表述对冲，\n  审计时把方向核对列为必查项。生图工具落盘在会话资产目录时，\n  须 cp 归档进 `candidates/` 再审计。\n- 再审一轮：两张都过合同审计 → 选综合最优 1 张为**参照定稿**；\n  都有硬伤 → 取伤少者，硬伤记入 ledger 交 Phase C 重建时修正\n  （重建是矢量级控制，能修生图模型改不动的毛病）。两轮共 6 次生图为\n  预算上限，不许无限重试。\n\n## Phase C：可编辑化重建（测量驱动，凡有生图参照的图都走）\n\n把参照定稿重建为 figspec，产出可编辑矢量——这是交付物的唯一来源，\nAI 栅格只是参照。方法论吸收测量驱动重建：**先测量、再重建、后对照**。\n\n1. **测量**：Read 参照图，逐区域记录版式测量表（模块相对位置/尺寸、\n   连线拓扑、颜色采样 hex、文字内容与层级）——写进 figure_plan.md\n   的重建测量节。\n2. **重建**：`figspec_schema()` 拿 schema → 按测量表写 figspec（文字用\n   白名单矫正生图拼写错误；结构以 A2 合同为准，参照图与合同冲突时\n   **合同赢**）→ `validate_figspec` → `render_figure`。\n   figspec 实战要点：深色头带白字用 node 的 `label_color`/`label_bold`；\n   标题样式用顶层 `title_style`；边默认色在 defaults 里键名是\n   `edge_color`/`edge_width`；自动折行按宽度硬切会切词——多词 label\n   一律手工 `\\n` 控行；边只能连 node 不能连 group——「连到分组带」的\n   合同边用组边缘的隐形锚点小节点（`label:\"\", fill/stroke 同组底色`）\n   落点；超长 edge label 改用 texts 独立摆放。\n   **美学 lint（机械化的合同条款）**：`validate_figspec` / `render_figure` 除排版\n   项外还跑 `server/core/aesthetics.py`——配色色系数、彩虹泳道、饱和色块比例、\n   近失对齐（1–8px）、兄弟节点尺寸一致性、越界/留白失衡、间距过密、连线穿\n   节点、交叉过多、描边档数、标题层级。其中 **≥4 色系、彩虹泳道、越界为\n   error 直接拒绝出图**；其余为 warning——**每条 warning 要么改 figspec 消掉，\n   要么在 figure_plan.md 写一行「保留理由」**（如「徽章有意错开」），不许\n   带着未处理的 warning 置 `figures_ready`。「看起来还行」不是理由：这些指标\n   正是审稿人肉眼说「有点乱」时实际在感知的东西。\n   **出版级版式硬规范**（实测迭代出的顶会观感底线，重建时按此自查）：\n   - **字号层级表**（硬闸门：render_figure 内置 lint，印刷等效\n     `pt = px × 468 / canvas.width` 低于 4.5pt 拒绝渲染，<5.2pt 警告）。\n     以 1500px 宽画布为基准（画布不同按比例换算）：\n\n     | 元素 | px | 印刷等效 |\n     |---|---|---|\n     | 图标题 | 26–30 | ≥8.1pt |\n     | lane/组标签（渲染器自动加粗） | 18–20 | ≥5.6pt |\n     | 节点主标（**默认加粗**，显式 `label_bold:false` 才取消） | 17–18 | ≥5.3pt |\n     | 节点副文（自动 = 主标×0.85，下限 10.5px；主标 ≥17.5 时副文才稳过线） | 14.5+ | ≥4.5pt |\n     | 边标签 / 端点徽章 | 14.5–15.5 | ≥4.5pt |\n     | 脚注/图例 | 15–16 | ≥4.7pt |\n\n     字号要体现信息层级：**组/lane 标签 ≥ 节点主标**（lint 会对\n     「小标题比正文小」直接告警），主链节点 > 支线节点 > 注释。\n     **宁缩画布、勿缩字号**——空间不够时精简文本或压缩布局，\n     不许把字调到地板下。\n   - **文字-形状适配**（lint 自动查，写 figspec 时预防）：斜边形状的\n     有效文本区远小于外框（diamond 55%、hexagon 70%、ellipse 72%、\n     stadium 86% 宽），长文本放矩形卡，菱形/六边形只放短判定语；\n     多行文本行数由渲染器/lint 共用的按词折行 + Helvetica 真实字宽表（大写≈0.7em、\n     小写≈0.5em、`≤ × ≥`≈0.58em，粗体 ×1.08）算出；行数×1.25×字号不得超过\n     有效高。大写/符号密集的粗体短语（\"FWHM ≤ 1.3× · SSA ≥\"）比小写句子宽\n     得多，别按字符数目测。draw.io 产物带显式 <br/>，与 SVG 逐行一致。端点徽章（stadium chip）单行放不下就加高到两行\n     体量（h ≥ 字号×2.5×1.25），禁止让文字贴边框。\n   - 密度是**双向约束**：画布宽 ≤ 正文字号×122（防稀疏），同时留足\n     呼吸空间（防拥挤，见下）。稀疏时首选**全局坐标等比缩小而字号\n     不变**；缩后必须复查下面的拥挤下限，压过头比稀疏更难看。\n   - 拥挤下限（任何一条不满足就放宽画布，勿缩字号）：\n     列间若放注释文字，走廊宽 ≥ 注释最宽行宽×1.15（三行窄注释优于\n     两行宽注释）；同列卡片纵向间隙 ≥ 字号×0.9；注释/独立文字距\n     画布边缘 ≥ 字号×0.8，禁止顶边。\n   - 层次四件套：标题带/头带 `shadow:true` + 深底白粗字；卡片白底 +\n     中饱和度描边 `stroke_width≥1.6`；容器淡色底（非纯白）+ 浅描边；\n     主链边 `width≥3`（箭头随线宽自动放大）。\n   - 强调元素（如 Route-C 归属叶）用辅色描边 + 加粗 `stroke_width:2`\n     单独高亮；徽章用 stadium 小节点直接携带 `label_color` 文字，\n     不要 texts 绕行。徽章**不许骑跨带文字卡片的边缘**（会遮字）——\n     外置到母卡正下方、间隙 ≈4px 表从属。\n   - 边的出点要避让徽章等贴附元素：必要时加一个与源卡片中心同高的\n     waypoint，强制从卡片左/右缘干净出线，禁止斜穿贴附徽章。\n   - 各区纵向空隙 ≤ 正文字号×4；图例/脚注紧贴主体（空隙 ≤ 字号×5），\n     禁止大片下部留白；图例各组文字间距按实测文字宽排布，禁止重叠。\n3. **对照自检（≤3 轮）**：对照 png 以 `drawio_export` 导出为准\n   （render_figure 的 cairosvg 光栅无字体 fallback，`→/ν/≥` 等字符\n   可能画成豆腐块，勿据此误判；SVG/drawio 源码文字以逐字符核对为准）。\n   Read 导出 png 与参照图并排对照——\n   布局拓扑一致？模块/边无缺漏？文字 ⊆ 白名单（逐字）？配色贴合？\n   渲染级检查：文字溢出？连线穿节点？分组框住成员？\n   语义级：B2/B3 遗留 issue 是否已在重建中修复？\n   **学术观感终检**：与 style_bank 范图并排——配色克制度、信息密度、\n   字号层级是否达到「可以直接印进顶刊」的观感，花哨即回改。\n   注意 drawio 导出按内容裁边、坐标系与画布不同：waypoint/几何对账\n   以 .drawio XML 为准，不做导出图的像素级坐标对账。\n   有问题改 figspec 重渲染；3 轮后仍有硬伤记 issue 交人决策。\n4. 无生图通道的降级路径：跳过 1-2，直接按 A2 合同写 figspec 走 3 的\n   检查单（含学术观感终检）。\n\n## 交付与登记\n\n- 每图四件套：`workspace/figures/svg/<name>.svg`（论文侧，LaTeX 用\n  `drawio_export` 转 pdf/png 嵌入）、`drawio/<name>.drawio`（draw.io\n  Desktop / app.diagrams.net 直接可编辑）、`figspec/<name>.json`\n  （单一事实源）、主图另附 `candidates/<fig>/`（两轮候选与参照定稿，\n  审计可溯源）。\n- 每图写 caption 草稿（图讲什么 + 符号约定）存 figure_plan.md 供 writer。\n\n### 箭头与连接器专项检查（每张图必做）\n\n- 箭头必须与连线端点绑定：SVG 使用 `marker-end`/`marker-start`，Draw.io\n  使用原生 `source`/`target` 连接器；禁止把三角形箭头头部作为独立装饰图元\n  手工摆在路径旁边。\n- 箭头尖端应落在目标边界（或明确的隐形锚点）上，末段切线与箭头方向一致；\n  曲线和折线在 200% 放大、SVG/PNG 和 PDF 三种输出中均不得出现断缝、反向或\n  飘离端点。导出 Draw.io 后再次检查连接器的 `endArrow`、`endFill`、\n  `targetSpacing` 和折点，避免自动 routing 产生视觉脱节。\n- 生图参照中的箭头只作为构图提示，重建时必须重新计算端点和方向；若发现\n  脱节，优先修正路径几何/连接器属性，不通过移动独立箭头头部补救。\n- 全部图完成后 `loopctl gate --name figures_ready --status PASS\n  --detail \"<N 图 svg+drawio 齐；主图 M 张走两轮候选制（6 生图/图上限），\n  审计 ledger 在 figure_plan.md；lint warning 0 条或逐条附保留理由>\"`。\n  置 gate 前对每张图的 figspec 重跑一次 `validate_figspec`，把返回的\n  `typo_warnings` 原文贴进 figure_plan.md 的「lint 收尾」节并逐条对应处置。独立图纸任务（无 loop 会话、\n  `state/ledger.json` 未 init）不必强行 gate——交付登记写进\n  figure_plan.md 即可。\n\n## 硬性规则\n\n- 交付物必须可编辑（svg+drawio）；位图永不直接进论文图池。\n- 两轮候选的每张生图、每条 ledger issue、每次重建对照都要在\n  figure_plan.md 留痕——审计链完整才许过闸。\n- 风格库缺失不阻塞：按合同默认配色执行并记账。\n- 交付前对包含图注或图中文字的稿件运行\n  `.venv/bin/python tools/academic_language_guard.py workspace/drafts/sections\n  workspace/drafts/main.tex`；命中内部控制术语时先修改图稿和 caption，\n  再进行 figures_ready 登记。\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
<HOME>"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_2","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"python3 - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\np=Path('skills/goai-survey-writer/SKILL.md')\nprint(p.read_text())\nPY\"","aggregated_output":"---\nname: goai-survey-writer\ndescription: Use when drafting the survey manuscript — 综述写作 agent：贡献先行 + 五步流水线：taxonomy → 引用支持库 → 章节蓝图 → 逐节写作 → 精修，claim 级引用绑定，LaTeX 交付。触发词：「写综述」「survey draft」「组稿」「写 related work」。\n---\n\n# GoAI Survey-Writer —— 综述写作 agent\n\n两条工作原则：\n- **贡献先行**：没确认综述的贡献与 motivation 不动笔；\n  引用支持库让每个候选引用先绑定到句子级 claim；产物链可审计。\n- **分步流水线**：outline → literature review → section writing →\n  refinement，配 halt rules（≥90% 引用整合率、防评审博弈）。\n\n## 唯一引用池\n\n只允许引用 `workspace/library/references.bib`（已过 ref_gate）里的 key。\n写作中发现需要库外文献 → 开 issue 请 lit_search 补检，**不许手写 bib 条目**。\n\n## 语言契约（scoping 定死，全程一致）\n\n交付语言在 scope.md 里显式记录：用户指定为准；未指定时跟随主题语言。\n语言决定模板与排版规范，**禁止中文正文套英文模板**（Abstract/Table 标签\n混排是杂交文档，tex_guard 会告警）：\n- 英文交付 → `templates/survey_main.tex`（article + newtx + pdflatex/xelatex）；\n- 中文交付 → `templates/survey_main_zh.tex`（ctexart + fandol 字库，\n  **必须 xelatex**），标签自动本地化（摘要/图/表/参考文献）。中文细则：\n  正文标点全角；中西文间隙交给 xeCJK，禁手工空格；段首加粗小标签用\n  「……：」或 `\\paragraph{}`，禁英文式 run-in「标签。」；页眉短题用楷体。\n- 两种语言的参考文献均保持 natbib 数字制；正文语言与文献条目语言允许\n  不同（中文综述引英文文献是常态，不翻译条目）。\n\n## 术语防火墙（内部词汇不入正文）\n\n流水线内部词汇——gate/issue/ledger/loopctl、ref_gate、niche-balanced、\ncomprehensive 档、bank、WARN 等——**禁止出现在题目/摘要/正文/表格/图注**\n里。读者面前只有学术语言：「检索截至 2026-08-31」而不是「ref_gate 后」。\n证据分级代号（如 D0/D1/N1/P1、strong/weak）如果确要作为论文的记号体系，\n必须在正文里正式定义（表格或术语节），排版用正体或小型大写，\n**不用 `\\texttt`**。`\\texttt` 只留给真正的代码、命令、文件名；\n缺失值/未报道一律用 —（em dash）或「未报道/not reported」，\n禁止打字机体 `NA` 铺表——tex_guard 对 `\\texttt` 密度有告警线。\n\n## 阶段零：风格与语料装载（可与文献检索并行）\n\n### 0a 领域风格卡（来自 goai-style-bank）\n\n优先消费 `workspace/style_bank/writing_style_cards.md`（30 篇经典综述\n归纳的结构骨架/句式模式/引用密度基准/对比表习惯）。风格库缺失或为\n浅层（WARN）时降级：自行挑 2-3 篇公认高质量综述精读，产出\n`workspace/notes/style_notes.md` 补位。阶段三的蓝图必须引用风格卡\n（或 style_notes）的结论；与默认骨架冲突时，以领域归纳骨架为准并在\n蓝图里说明理由。量化基准（篇均引用数/密度）直接决定 bank_check 与\nbib_guard 的参数取值，在账本记 decision。\n\n### 0b 专业语料库（super_library）\n\n探测顺序：`$GOAI_SUPERLIB` 环境变量 → `~/Code/super_library` →\n不存在则记账降级（跳过本节，不阻塞）。存在时**必须**使用：\n\n- 每节动笔前拉一次有界语料包（从 super_library 仓库根执行）：\n\n  ```\n  python3 scripts/superlib.py bundle \\\n      --rhetoric-query \"<本节的表达需求>\" \\\n      --technical-query \"<本节核心概念>\" \\\n      --domain <domain> --section <section> --intent <intent> \\\n      --limit 4 --max-chars 24000 [--guide <guide-id>]\n  ```\n\n- section 协议与修辞句式卡是**领域无关**的，任何主题都用；术语卡只在\n  主题落在其覆盖域（world models / RL / embodied AI / VLA）时用，\n  域外主题（如材料化学）跳过术语卡并记账。\n- 实验/对比表用其 `template --list` 的表格模板起手（替换全部 `SL_*`）。\n- 语料是**语言与修辞的护栏**，不是证据来源：不得把语料库定义当引文，\n  不得复制原句成文。\n- 阶段五精修后跑其 wording lint：\n  `python3 scripts/superlib.py lint --text-file <draft> --bib <refs.bib>`，\n  lint 结果记入 revision_log。\n\n## 阶段一：taxonomy（orchestrator 单独调用）\n\n1. 通读 `workspace/library/papers.jsonl`（标题+摘要）与阅读卡片。\n2. 产出 `workspace/notes/taxonomy.md`：树形分类法，每个叶节点 ≥3 篇支撑\n   文献（key 列表）；孤儿论文单列「未归类」等待处理。\n3. 同时产出 `workspace/notes/contribution.md`：本综述的贡献声明\n   （新分类法？新对比框架?新 open problems？）+ motivation 一段。\n   这两个文件是全文的宪法。\n4. **呈报确认**：contribution.md 产出后，把贡献声明（给 2-3 个候选表述）\n   与 motivation 摘要呈给用户确认或修改；确认前 `taxonomy_ready` 只能记\n   PENDING，不得进入阶段二。用户明确不可达（全自动无人值守 run）时，\n   账本记 `--detail \"contribution 未经用户确认\"`，并在最终汇报中如实声明。\n   确认后 `loopctl gate --name taxonomy_ready --status PASS`。\n\n## 阶段二：引用支持库（citation support bank）\n\n产出 `workspace/notes/citation_bank.md`：按未来章节组织，每行 =\n`- [key] 一句话可支撑的 claim (strong|weak)`。\n规则：候选量 ≈ 目标引用数 × 1.5；近三年占比 ≥50%；\n每条都必须真的读过摘要（不确定的标 weak）。\n目标引用数与库规模联动：comprehensive 档（库 ≥100）的综述正文\n目标引用数 ≥80（顶刊综述常态是引用数≈库规模），且库内条目最终\n整合率仍须 ≥90%——不许「检索一大库、正文只用零头」。\n产完跑确定性校验（不过线先补库或补读，再进阶段三）：\n\n```\npython3 tools/bank_check.py workspace/notes/citation_bank.md \\\n    workspace/library/references.bib --target-cites <目标引用数>\n```\n\n阈值适配：默认线（候选量 ×1.5、近三年 ≥50%）按满配综述设计；lite/mini 或\n库规模受限的运行撞线时，先跑默认参数留下 FAIL 证据，再在账本记\n`log --event decision` 说明理由（库上限/奠基文献偏旧等）后按比例调\n`--min-recent`/`--min-ratio` 重跑——禁止不留痕直接降线；能补库时优先补库。\n\n## 阶段三：章节蓝图\n\n产出 `workspace/drafts/blueprint.md`，逐节写清：本节回答什么问题、\n覆盖 taxonomy 哪个分支、**支撑 contribution.md 中的哪一条贡献**、\n用哪些 bank 条目、配哪张图（figure_plan 里的名字）、预计字数、\n**完稿检查项**（本节写完后按什么标准自查，如「对比表覆盖该分支全部\n代表方法」）。任何一节「支撑贡献」或「完稿检查」为空即返工，不得进入\n阶段四；找不到贡献落点的节要么删、要么回头修订贡献声明。\n综述骨架默认（以 style_notes.md 归纳的范文骨架优先）：\nIntro → Background/Preliminaries → Taxonomy 总览（配主图） →\nper-branch 深入（每支一节，含对比表） → 讨论（趋势/矛盾/局限） →\nOpen Problems（含 idea-forge 产出） → Conclusion。\n\n**骨架强制项**（蓝图缺任何一项即返工）：\n- **行文路线图（roadmap figure）**：Intro 末尾或 §2 开头必须配一张\n  本文组织结构图——各节回答什么问题、按什么顺序推进、图表落在哪节。\n  在 figure_plan.md 登记为标准图（顶会综述标配，读者导航用）。\n- **近邻/同型体系小节**：材料与实验科学主题的 Intro 必须有独立小节\n  （或 ≥2 段）专讲相似体系的已有发现——同型结构、同家族化学、可迁移\n  工艺——逐条带引用；这是精确目标文献稀少时读者最需要的证据地图。\n  写不出来 = lit_search 的近邻检索面没做够，开 issue 返工检索。\n- **既有实验结论合集**：结果部分先给「前人实验结论的系统合集」\n  （条件-结果对照表 + 逐条结论），再进入本文的分析与新贡献；\n  结论不允许散落在叙述里让读者自己拼。\n- **新方向 → 推荐实验**：Open Problems / Future Directions 不许停留在\n  「值得进一步研究」——每个方向必须落到可执行建议：推荐做什么合成\n  实验、采用什么工艺路线、用什么前驱体（消费 idea-forge 调用\n  goai-retro MCP 预测工具的产物，标注「模型预测，待实验验证」）。\n- **Conclusion 双段式**：(a) 主要结论按证据强度总结；(b) 「最有科学\n  发现价值的下一步实验」优先级清单（哪个实验能最快裁决当前最大的\n  不确定性），与 Open Problems 的方向一一呼应。\n\n**节标题词法**（顶刊综述口径，蓝图定标题时执行、final 复查）：\n- 2–6 词名词短语，用领域标准术语点名对象；方法论细节留给正文。\n- 禁三连并列标题（\"A, B, and C\" 式）；禁机关词堆叠——method /\n  rules / aspects / considerations 这类只听着学术、不带信息的词\n  不入标题。\n- 层级分工：`\\section` 定主题域，`\\subsection` 定分支或机制，\n  枚举性细项用 `\\paragraph` 或正文 run-in，不提升为编号标题。\n- 对照：✗ \"Scope, evidence method, and comparison rules\" →\n  ✓ \"Scope and Evidence Criteria\"；✗ \"Establish composition and\n  provenance\"（小节标题） → ✓ \"Composition and Provenance\"。\n- super_library 装载成功时，标题词面过一遍它的 lint\n  （`python3 scripts/superlib.py lint --text-file <标题清单>`），\n  装饰性同义词与直译腔按报告修。\n\n## 阶段四：逐节写作（可并行）\n\n每节独立成文件 `workspace/drafts/sections/NN_<slug>.tex`。硬约束：\n- **claim-cite 绑定**：每个事实性 claim 后必须跟 `\\cite{key}`，key 来自\n  bank；写不出支撑就删 claim 或降级为 \"可能/或许\" 并明说是推测；\n- 缺证据槽位的另一种合法处理：保留结构并插入\n  `% 待补证据: <需要什么数据/文献>` 注释（编译不可见、可 grep），同时在\n  账本开 minor issue 移交 final 清理。严禁第三种：用编造内容填槽；\n- 对比表的每个单元格可溯源到对应论文；\n- 密度线：每千词 ≥8 次引用（综述标准）；\n- 图文一致：引用图必须解释图中主线，与 caption 不重复；\n- 语言风格：结论按证据强度陈述，不写忏悔式套话（\"further research is\n  needed\" 只许出现在 Limitations）；\n- **列表排版**（顶刊口径，TeX 与 HTML 交付一体适用）：≤4 个短项\n  （每项 <15 词）一律段内 run-in 列举——\"(i) …; (ii) …; (iii) …\"，\n  不开显示列表；显示列表（enumitem `nosep`）只给每项 ≥1 完整句的\n  内容；禁止每项以同一动词开头的平行复读（\"Establish… Establish…\n  Establish…\"），改名词短语引导或并成一句；真正的步骤/协议才用\n  编号列表，平行要素用 run-in 或 itemize；\n- **表格设计规范**（数据表是综述的门面，按数据形状设计而不是硬塞）：\n  - 一张逻辑表**禁止拆成上下两半共享行号**让读者自己拼——列太多时按\n    「主题分组拆成多张完整子表」（各自带表头与 caption）、转置、或\n    `landscape` 横排；正文表列数指导线 ≤7，超线必须重新设计；\n  - 单元格内容是**读者语言**：禁止出现裸 BibTeX key（tex_guard 直接\n    阻塞），来源一律 `\\cite{key}` 或「作者 (年份) \\cite{key}」；\n  - 缺失值统一 — 或「未报道」，禁止整表铺 `\\texttt{NA}`；一行内\n    多字段全缺时合并为一格说明，不逐格复读；\n  - 长表（>1 页）用 `longtable` 并重复表头；窄列一律模板的 `P{}` 列型；\n  - 每张表交稿前自查：拿掉正文，单看此表 + caption 能否自解释。\n- **材料领域判读规则**（条件表与路线分类时执行，来源：领域专家意见）：\n  - 记录中出现 **Pt 坩埚 / Au 坩埚**（及 Ir/刚玉坩埚 + 高温慢冷组合）\n    基本可判定为熔体/助熔剂晶体生长路线，归类时不得混入普通固相烧结；\n    坩埚材质本身就是路线证据，条件表应保留该字段；\n  - 讨论合成窗口、相稳定性或新配方时必须核查**相图**：库内有相图\n    文献就引用并对照（组分点落在哪个相区、有无共晶/包晶陷阱）；\n    检索不到目标体系相图时明确写「该体系相图未见报道」，并把\n    「测定相图」列入实验建议——不许对相关系保持沉默。\n- 并行写作时只碰自己的节文件，公共文件（main.tex/bib）只由汇合者动。\n\n### 学术语言与内部术语隔离\n\n正文、摘要、标题、表头、图中文字和图注必须使用本学科的研究对象、实验\n条件、结构关系与表征方法来表述；账本、提示词和程序日志中的内部术语不得\n直接进入论文。写作时将内部表达转换为下列学术表达：\n\n| 内部表达（仅限 agent 状态） | 论文表达 |\n|---|---|\n| 证据级、比较标签 | 与目标相的关系、分类依据 |\n| 过闸、证据包、引用池 | 已通过文献核查、本文获得的文献材料、本文核查的文献 |\n| 字段、字段归一化 | 实验项目、合成条件的统一比较 |\n| 验证终点、端点 | 表征方法、参照相 |\n| 降权、迁移权限、工具箱 | 限制其适用范围、可外推范围、方法参照 |\n| 身份锚点、谱系核验、验证闭环 | 直接结构依据、结构关系复核、可迭代的实验依据 |\n\n不要在论文中使用“过闸”“标签”“字段”“端点”“证据包”“工具箱”等\n软件流程隐喻。完成组稿后运行：\n\n```bash\n.venv/bin/python tools/academic_language_guard.py workspace/drafts/sections workspace/drafts/main.tex\n```\n\n该检查出现任何未解释的术语均视为写作阻塞项；若某术语确为研究对象本身，\n必须在 `revision_log.md` 说明理由后以 `--allow` 明确放行。\n\n## 阶段五：组装与精修\n\n1. 按语言契约选模板组装（英文 `templates/survey_main.tex`、中文\n   `templates/survey_main_zh.tex`），`\\input` 各节。模板内置排版\n   规范不许降级：Times 字体系（newtx，加载顺序 amsmath→newtxtext→\n   newtxmath，禁 amssymb）、引用/交叉引用/URL 统一学术蓝\n   （`colorlinks` + `citecolor=blue`）、caption 小号加粗标签、\n   `\\arraystretch 1.18`、紧凑节标题、fancyhdr 运行页眉、\n   参考文献前 `\\clearpage`。表格定宽列一律用模板的 `P{宽}`\n   （raggedright）列型，禁用裸 `p{宽}`——窄列两端对齐会产生\n   justify 空洞，是\"表格乱\"的头号来源；正文含 Unicode 组合符/希腊\n   字母时用 xelatex 编译（中文模板必须 xelatex）。组装时必须完成\n   两处替换：页眉短题（`TODO` 短题→论文短题）；主标题超一行时\n   **手工断行成 2–3 行且行长均衡**，禁止让 LaTeX 自动折出孤词行。\n   组装同时做 **bib 字段卫生**（bib_guard 会告警）：条目 doi 与 url\n   同存时删 url 留 doi（长 URL 断行是参考文献区最难看的伤）；title\n   中化学式/多大写缩写（BaZn2Si2O7、COF、LLZO…）加 `{}` 保护，\n   防止 plainnat 压成 `bazn 2 si 2 o 7` 碎片。\n2. 一致性闸门（未定义 key＝阻塞；库内条目整合率 <90%＝阻塞——孤儿条目\n   要么在正文找到落点，要么开 issue 交 lit_search 评估后移出库，\n   不许留着充数）：\n\n   ```\n   python3 tools/bib_guard.py workspace/drafts/sections \\\n       workspace/library/references.bib --min-integration 0.9 --min-cites-per-1k 8\n   ```\n\n3. 自精修一轮（halt rules）：只修 clarity/流畅/重复，\n   **不许**为讨好审稿删数据、删 limitation、改结论强度；每处改动在\n   `workspace/drafts/revision_log.md` 留一行。拿不准是否更好的修改，\n   在 revision_log 保留原文并标 `[REVERT-CANDIDATE]`，交 review 轮裁决；\n   精修后必须复跑一致性闸门，引用密度或整合率较精修前下降即回滚该处修改。\n   **语言自然度专项**（拗口是最常见的失败模式，两种语言都查）：\n   - 逐段做朗读测试：一口气读不顺、定语连环套、一句超过 40 词/60 字\n     的拆句重写；\n   - 英文稿禁中式英语（逐字直译的搭配、\"research(es)\" 滥用、名词化\n     堆叠 the utilization of…），动词优先、主语就近；\n   - 中文稿禁翻译腔（\"被\"字滥用、\"进行了…的研究\"、\"对于…而言\"空转、\n     欧化长定语），改短句与主动语态；\n   - 每节抽 2 段与 style_bank 写作卡的句式模式对照，偏离领域惯用\n     表达的改写；super_library lint 报告里的 wording 项逐条处理。\n4. 组稿完整性闸门：`python3 tools/tex_guard.py workspace/drafts` ——\n   阻塞项：TODO 占位残留（模板的标题/作者/摘要必须已替换）、`\\input` 与\n   图文件存在、`\\ref` 无悬空、环境与花括号闭合、**裸 BibTeX key 泄漏到\n   正文**（含与汉字紧贴的 key；确属同形词可在行尾注释\n   `% tex-guard: allow-key` 豁免）；告警项：`\\texttt` 密度过高、中文稿\n   套英文模板。任一阻塞项不得记 `draft_complete`，告警项逐条处理或在\n   revision_log 说明原因。有 latex 环境则再编译验证（中文稿 xelatex；\n   图一律先 `drawio_export` 出 pdf 再 `\\includegraphics`，不依赖\n   `\\includesvg`），编译告警逐条处理；编译后 `pdftoppm` 抽首页、\n   一张表所在页、参考文献页各看一眼——标签语言、表格完整性、文献条目\n   有无被压小写的化学式，这三处是制作质量事故的高发区。\n   另外，`academic_language_guard.py` 必须通过，确保内部控制语言没有泄漏\n   到正文、表格和图注。\n5. `loopctl gate --name draft_complete --status PASS\n   --inputs workspace/drafts/main.tex,workspace/library/references.bib`\n   并交 review。\n\n## 返工协议\n\n收到 reviewer 的 issue（账本里 target=writing）：逐条修，修完\n`loopctl issue close --id <I?> --note \"<改了什么>\"`；不同意的意见要在\nrevision_log 里写反驳理由并保留原文，交由下轮 review 仲裁，不许静默忽略。\n\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
<HOME>"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_5","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"wc -l docs/LOOP_PROTOCOL.md && python3 - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\nlines=Path('docs/LOOP_PROTOCOL.md').read_text().splitlines()\nfor i,l in enumerate(lines,1): print(f'{i}: {l}')\nPY\"","aggregated_output":"122 docs/LOOP_PROTOCOL.md\n1: # 回环协议（Loop Protocol）\n2: \n3: 多 agent 协作的核心不是「谁调用谁」，而是**账本驱动的状态机**：\n4: 每个 agent 干完活把状态写回账本，orchestrator 看账本决定下一步。\n5: 本文件是协议规范；orchestrator skill 是它的执行者。\n6: \n7: ## 阶段与闸门\n8: \n9: | # | 阶段 | 执行者 | 出口闸门 | 闸门判据 |\n10: |---|------|--------|---------|---------|\n11: | 0 | scoping | orchestrator+人 | `scope_confirmed` | scope.md 有主题/边界/子主题清单/目标篇幅/**交付语言**；材料主题含「近邻/同型体系」「相图与热力学」子主题 |\n12: | 1 | lit_search | goai-lit-search | `lit_coverage` | coverage_report 全子主题 ok；档位配额达标（comprehensive ≥100）；材料主题两条强制检索面已做 |\n13: | 2 | ref_gate | goai-ref-guard | `ref_integrity` | references.bib 零 UNVERIFIED/MISMATCH |\n14: | 3 | taxonomy | goai-survey-writer | `taxonomy_ready` | 每叶 ≥3 篇支撑；孤儿论文有处置；贡献声明经用户确认（不可达时降级记录） |\n15: | 4a | figures | goai-figure-studio/-editable | `figures_ready` | 每图 svg+drawio 齐全且过自检；**含行文路线图**；主图走 image-first 候选制 |\n16: | 4b | writing | goai-survey-writer | `draft_complete` | bib_guard + tex_guard PASS；全节成文；语言契约对应模板；骨架强制项齐（近邻体系节 / 实验结论合集 / 方向→工艺+前驱体 / 结论双段式） |\n17: | 4c | ideas | goai-idea-forge | `ideas_reviewed` | 每条 idea 过对抗审 + 引用二审；材料 idea 必带 retro MCP 前驱体预测（跳过时记 WARN） |\n18: | 5 | review | goai-reviewer | `review_pass` | 0 blocker 且 0 major（PASS 须带审稿回执）；或连续两轮仅 minor；终审三视角含**制作质量**逐页 PDF 审计 |\n19: | 6 | final | orchestrator | （无独立 gate） | `check-done` 通过：gate 全 PASS/WARN 且 0 open blocker/major（open minor 由 final 清理后 close） |\n20: \n21: 4a/4b/4c 无写冲突，**可并行**（见 parallel_run.sh）。\n22: \n23: ## Issue 路由表\n24: \n25: review 产出的 issue 按 target 字段路由回源头阶段：\n26: \n27: | target | 谁接活 | 典型内容 |\n28: |--------|--------|---------|\n29: | lit_search | goai-lit-search | 覆盖缺口、漏热点 → 增量补检（不重跑全量） |\n30: | ref_gate | goai-ref-guard | 引用可疑、wrong-context |\n31: | taxonomy | goai-survey-writer | 分类不 MECE、章节错位 |\n32: | figures | goai-figure-studio | 图文不符、图不可读、配色花哨/非学术观感 |\n33: | writing | goai-survey-writer | 无证据断言、术语漂移、AI 腔、拗口/翻译腔、制作质量（表格拆半/裸 key/NA 铺表/中英杂交/内部术语泄漏/参考文献区损坏） |\n34: | ideas | goai-idea-forge | 证据不实、安全缺失、方向未落到工艺+前驱体 |\n35: \n36: **级联规则**：上游返工后，其下游闸门自动失效需复核——\n37: lit_search 变 → ref_gate、taxonomy 需复核；taxonomy 变 → figures、writing 需复核。\n38: orchestrator 负责按此把受影响闸门重置为 PENDING（`gate --status PENDING`）。\n39: 机器兜底：gate 记录时带 `--inputs <产物文件列表>` 存 sha256 指纹，\n40: `check-done` 会重算指纹，发现上游产物已变更就自动把该 gate 置回 PENDING\n41: 并提示复审——级联失效不依赖编排者记性。\n42: \n43: ## 轮次与终止\n44: \n45: - 一轮 = 阶段 1→5 走完一遍（返工只重跑受影响链路）。\n46: - `next_round` 时机：review 未过且 issue 已路由完毕。\n47: - **终止条件**（满足其一）：\n48:   1. `check-done` 退出码 0 → 交付；open minor 由 final 阶段清理完后逐条 close。\n49:      `check-done` 的放行条件是**机械**的：(a) 九个必需 gate\n50:      （scope_confirmed / lit_coverage / style_bank_ready / ref_integrity /\n51:      taxonomy_ready / figures_ready / ideas_reviewed / draft_complete /\n52:      review_pass）**全部已记录**且为 PASS/WARN——缺一个即该阶段从未执行，\n53:      账本停在半路不得宣告完成；跳过必须显式记 WARN；自造 gate 名不计入；\n54:      (b) 无 open blocker/major；(c) `review_pass` 的回执 trace 文件真实存在\n55:      且非占位（`gate` 命令对无回执/空 trace 的 PASS 直接拒绝，check-done\n56:      再核一遍防事后删档）。\n57:   2. 达 `--max-rounds`（默认 5）→ 强制收敛：带着未清 minor 交付 + 遗留清单；\n58:   3. 同一 issue 三轮未收敛 → 升级人类决策，暂停该链路。\n59: - **反空转**（阶梯执行，不允许原地换个说法重试）：任何 agent 连续两次\n60:   运行账本无新增 log → orchestrator 判定卡死，记 `event=stall`。\n61:   第一次 stall 换策略（缩小任务/换 agent）并记录所换策略；同一阶段\n62:   第二次 stall 必须升级人类，不得再自选换策略。空转检测只负责报警与\n63:   记录，不得代替审稿闸门改判任何结论。\n64: \n65: ## 账本操作速查\n66: \n67: ```bash\n68: T=tools/loopctl.py\n69: python3 $T init --topic \"LLM agents for chemistry\" --max-rounds 5 \\\n70:         --effort balanced --strictness normal --auto-proceed true\n71: python3 $T status                          # 全景：阶段/闸门/开放 issue\n72: python3 $T advance --to lit_search         # 进入阶段\n73: python3 $T gate --name lit_coverage --status PASS --detail \"48 篇, 新增 3\" \\\n74:         --inputs workspace/library/papers.jsonl        # 产物指纹，防 stale\n75: python3 $T gate --name review_pass --status PASS \\\n76:         --receipt \"model=<审稿模型>;trace=workspace/state/review_traces/round2_1.md\"\n77: python3 $T issue add --from-agent goai-reviewer --target writing \\\n78:         --severity major --text \"S4.2 无证据断言\"\n79: python3 $T issue close --id I1 --note \"已补 \\cite{...}\"\n80: python3 $T log --stage writing --agent goai-survey-writer --event done\n81: python3 $T next-round                      # round+1\n82: python3 $T check-done                      # 退出码 0=可交付（重算指纹）\n83: ```\n84: \n85: ## 并行执行协议\n86: \n87: ```bash\n88: # tasks.tsv：每行 \"任务名<TAB>提示词<TAB>本轮产物<TAB>前序依赖（均可选、逗号分隔）\"\n89: bash tools/parallel_run.sh --backend codex --jobs 3 tasks.tsv\n90: # 产物：workspace/state/parallel/<run_id>/<任务名>.{jsonl,stderr.log,final.md,process_exit,status,exit}\n91: ```\n92: 规约：\n93: 1. 并行任务**只写自己的分片文件**（sections/NN_*.tex、figures/<name>.*）；\n94: 2. 账本写入靠 loopctl 的文件锁串行化，安全；\n95: 3. 汇合者（orchestrator）等全部 exit 码，失败任务单独重跑，不阻塞成功者；\n96: 4. 建议并行度 ≤4（受 API 限流与本机内存约束）。\n97: 5. Codex 默认以 `workspace-write` 运行；stderr 与 JSONL 分流，保证轨迹可解析。\n98: 6. 后端退出码为 0 但第三列产物缺失、为空或本轮未更新时，runner 改记\n99:    exit=3，防止沿用旧文件造成假绿；路径前加 `=` 可只检查既有非空文件。\n100: 7. 第四列依赖必须引用本文件中已经出现的任务。依赖失败时消费者不启动并记\n101:    `BLOCKED_DEPENDENCY`，消除证据文件尚未生成就开始写作的竞态。\n102: 8. 声明产物的任务会收到增量落盘与禁止自读当前活动日志的协议。若进程超时但\n103:    全部声明产物已在本轮写出且非空，`.process_exit`保留124，`.status`记\n104:    `WARN_ARTIFACT_PASS_AFTER_TIMEOUT`，有效`.exit`为0；设\n105:    `RUNNER_TIMEOUT_ARTIFACT_POLICY=fail`可恢复严格失败策略。\n106: \n107: ## 人类介入点\n108: \n109: 默认全自动，四处建议人工过目——但每处都定义了**用户不可达时的降级路径**，\n110: 非交互客户端（只发一行主题、不会回复确认的场景）不允许卡死在停点上：\n111: \n112: - **scope.md 定稿**（方向错了后面全白干）：裸主题且无实质歧义时按已写明的\n113:   默认值自动确认并记 decision；只有歧义会改变研究对象时才真正停下来问。\n114: - **taxonomy 阶段的贡献声明与 motivation**（全文的宪法）：用户不可达时按\n115:   writer skill 的降级规则记录后继续。\n116: - **max-rounds 用尽仍有 blocker**（质量与截稿的取舍）：用户不可达时停止\n117:   并如实汇报未收敛项，绝不谎报完成。\n118: - **idea-forge 的化学实验方案**（安全责任必须人担）：**永不自动确认**；\n119:   用户不可达时该支线记 WARN skipped，终报如实说明，不输出可执行危险协议。\n120: \n121: 另有全局开关 `init --auto-proceed false`：每轮 review 结束后暂停，\n122: 等人类读完审稿报告再继续。该开关只控制轮间暂停，不改变上面四处的分级规则。\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
<HOME>"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_14","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"python3 - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\nfor f in ['workspace/notes/taxonomy.md','workspace/notes/contribution.md','workspace/notes/taxonomy_validation.md','workspace/state/llzo_writer_plan_validation.md']:\n print('\\\\n###',f,Path(f).stat().st_size)\n print(Path(f).read_text()[:12000])\nPY\"","aggregated_output":"\n### workspace/notes/taxonomy.md 13786\n# Faceted framework for LLZO synthesis, phase stabilization, and densification\n\n> **Status:** adopted for the A+B+C planning bundle. This framework is based on\n> the audited 46-paper collection, primarily at title/abstract level. Citation\n> keys are candidate anchors, not full-text verification of a factual claim.\n\n## How to read the framework\n\nThe framework has three coordinated views:\n\n1. a **primary process chain** used to order the review;\n2. a **composition/environment modifier facet** that can act across stages; and\n3. a **comparability/reproducibility evidence facet** used to judge whether\n   reported outcomes can be compared.\n\nThe complete framework is **not a single MECE tree**. Siblings within a local\nbranch are made as distinct as the current evidence permits, but a paper may\nreceive one primary-chain anchor plus several modifier and evidence tags. DOI and\nBibTeX-key traceability is preserved in the inventory at the end.\n\n## Facet 1 — primary process chain\n\n`P1 Powder synthesis -> P2 Phase/composition control -> P3 Thermal treatment/densification -> P4 Structure/transport readout`\n\n### P1.1 Solid-state reaction, precursor choice, and mixing\n\n- Boundary: the main intervention is precursor identity, mixing, or solid-state\n  powder formation; composition/defect questions are tagged in Facet 2.\n- 支撑文献：`heywood2023tailoring`, `rahmawati2021a`, `ilina2014lithium`, `norazman2021the`, `tan2012synthesis`, `rao2015in`\n\n### P1.2 Sol--gel, chelation, and other solution-mediated routes\n\n- Boundary: solution-scale mixing or gel/chelate chemistry is the defining\n  powder-forming route; later densification remains in P3.\n- 支撑文献：`rosenkiewitz2015nitrogen`, `kokal2011sol`, `sakamoto2013synthesis`, `kosir2022comparative`, `bae2019use`\n\n### P1.3 Coprecipitation, combustion, and rapid powder formation\n\n- Boundary: precipitation or combustion/rapid heating produces the powder; the\n  use of a dopant is separately tagged as a modifier.\n- 支撑文献：`hamao2015synthesis`, `weller2019nonaqueous`, `dandeneau2023rapid`, `padarti2018low`\n\n### P2.1 Li-sublattice substitution and cubic-phase control\n\n- Boundary: the principal variable is Al/Ga or another intervention associated\n  with the Li sublattice and phase stabilization, not the firing method.\n- 支撑文献：`shinawi2013stabilization`, `li2016ga`, `rosenkiewitz2015nitrogen`, `tao2022preparation`, `montoya2024lithium`, `raju2021crystal`\n\n### P2.2 Zr-site and multi-element substitution\n\n- Boundary: the principal variable is Ta/Nb/W or coupled substitution; an\n  additive used mainly during sintering is tagged M4 instead.\n- 支撑文献：`dong2019dual`, `yan2020submicron`, `zhang2022high`, `xue2020spark`, `luo2019influence`\n\n### P2.3 Stoichiometry, native defects, and phase evolution\n\n- Boundary: the research question centres on composition, defect populations,\n  or phase evolution rather than a single powder route or densification tool.\n- 支撑文献：`squires2019native`, `ilina2014lithium`, `parascos2022compositional`, `aleksandrov2021superionic`, `tan2012synthesis`, `schwab2023towards`\n\n### P3.1 Pressureless sintering and temperature--time windows\n\n- Boundary: conventional firing schedule, powder covering, or atmosphere is\n  evaluated without pressure/electric-field assistance; modifiers remain tagged.\n- 支撑文献：`schwab2023towards`, `li2016ga`, `lei2021fabrication`, `shen2020a`, `guo2023uniform`, `zhang2019densification`\n\n### P3.2 Pressure-, field-, and ultrafast-assisted densification\n\n- Boundary: applied pressure, electric field, hot pressing, SPS, or an ultrafast\n  schedule is the defining densification intervention.\n- 支撑文献：`dong2019dual`, `ihrig2021li7la3zr2o12`, `xue2020spark`, `yamada2016sintering`, `zhang2014field`, `david2015microstructure`, `tao2022preparation`\n\n### P3.3 Low-temperature and additive-assisted densification\n\n- Boundary: reduced processing temperature or additive-enabled densification is\n  the stated processing objective; M4 separately records the added material.\n- 支撑文献：`seo2020broad`, `zhou2024li5alo4`, `padarti2018low`, `bae2019use`, `zhang2019effects`, `zhang2020enhanced`\n\n### P4.1 Phase, density, and microstructure readout\n\n- Boundary: phase assemblage, relative density, grains, grain boundaries, or\n  porosity are the primary reported readouts; no causal direction is assumed.\n- 支撑文献：`david2015microstructure`, `seo2020broad`, `kosir2022comparative`, `zhang2020enhanced`, `zhang2019effects`, `yan2020submicron`, `rao2015in`\n\n### P4.2 Ionic-transport and stability readout\n\n- Boundary: total/bulk/grain-boundary conductivity, activation energy, or\n  stability is the primary outcome; measurement definitions must be retained.\n- 支撑文献：`raju2021crystal`, `xia2016ionic`, `david2015microstructure`, `yan2020submicron`, `weller2019nonaqueous`, `guo2023uniform`, `zhang2019densification`\n\n## Facet 2 — composition and environment modifiers\n\nThese tags do not form serial process stages and can co-occur with any P tag.\n\n### M1 Dopant identity, site, and coupled composition\n\n- Records Al/Ga/Ta/Nb/W or multi-element substitution without assuming a\n  site-specific mechanism unless full-text evidence later establishes it.\n- 支撑文献：`shinawi2013stabilization`, `squires2019native`, `zhang2022high`, `li2016ga`, `tao2022preparation`, `dong2019dual`, `xue2020spark`, `yan2020submicron`, `parascos2022compositional`\n\n### M2 Lithium inventory, volatilization, and replenishment\n\n- Separates starting lithium excess/stoichiometry from firing-stage lithium-loss\n  control, Li2O activity, and mother/cover-powder replenishment.\n- 支撑文献：`montoya2024lithium`, `schwab2023towards`, `heywood2023tailoring`, `huang2019manipulating`, `zhang2019densification`, `huang2019searching`, `lan2019investigation`, `ilina2014lithium`, `norazman2021the`\n\n### M3 Crucible, cover powder, atmosphere, and exposure\n\n- Covers processing boundary conditions including crucible, oxygen/air,\n  powder-cover geometry, moisture/air exposure, and Li/H exchange.\n- 支撑文献：`xia2016ionic`, `huang2019manipulating`, `shen2020a`, `rosen2021controlling`, `guo2023uniform`, `lan2019investigation`, `zhang2019densification`\n\n### M4 Sintering additives and intergranular reaction products\n\n- Records the identity and nominal role of added materials; title/abstract\n  associations do not by themselves prove a densification or transport mechanism.\n- 支撑文献：`zhang2022high`, `luo2019influence`, `zhang2020enhanced`, `zhang2019effects`, `huang2019searching`, `zhou2024li5alo4`\n\n## Facet 3 — comparability and reproducibility evidence\n\nThese tags state what must be reported before comparison; they are not outcomes.\n\n### E1 Composition and powder-route record\n\n- Minimum fields: nominal/measured composition, dopant, precursor identities,\n  lithium excess, mixing, powder route, and precursor homogeneity.\n- 支撑文献：`heywood2023tailoring`, `parascos2022compositional`, `kosir2022comparative`, `raju2021crystal`, `rahmawati2021a`, `weller2019nonaqueous`\n\n### E2 Thermal-process and densification record\n\n- Minimum fields: calcination/sintering temperature and time, heating schedule,\n  pressure/field, atmosphere, cover powder, crucible, additive, and density.\n- 支撑文献：`david2015microstructure`, `xue2020spark`, `shen2020a`, `seo2020broad`, `yan2020submicron`, `guo2023uniform`, `zhang2019densification`, `zhou2024li5alo4`\n\n### E3 Structure and transport measurement record\n\n- Minimum fields: phase method, density basis, grain/grain-boundary description,\n  conductivity type, temperature, electrode configuration, and uncertainty.\n- 支撑文献：`david2015microstructure`, `xia2016ionic`, `yan2020submicron`, `weller2019nonaqueous`, `kosir2022comparative`, `guo2023uniform`, `zhang2019densification`\n\n### E4 Replication, uniformity, and scale record\n\n- Minimum fields: batch count, spatial sampling, dispersion, sample geometry,\n  processing scale, and an explicit definition of reproducibility.\n- 支撑文献：`heywood2023tailoring`, `schwab2023towards`, `parascos2022compositional`, `rosen2021controlling`, `guo2023uniform`, `kosir2022comparative`\n\n## Boundary tests for ambiguous classifications\n\n| Ambiguous pair | Decision test | Representation |\n|---|---|---|\n| P1 precursor control vs P2 stoichiometry/defects | Is the controlled object the powder-forming route/mixing, or the composition/defect state? | Choose the closest primary anchor and retain E1/M1/M2 tags. |\n| P3.3 low-temperature densification vs M4 additive | Is reduced-temperature densification the process objective, or is the material identity the modifier? | A paper can be P3.3 + M4; the two facets are intentionally non-exclusive. |\n| M2 starting Li excess vs M3 firing environment | Was lithium changed in the batch formulation or supplied/controlled at the firing boundary? | Use M2 for inventory and M3 for boundary setup; use both when coupled. |\n| P3 densification vs P4 readout | Is the paper organized around a processing intervention or around measured structure/transport? | Assign one primary narrative anchor; retain E2/E3 fields either way. |\n| Modifier facet vs evidence facet | Does a label describe what was changed, or what must be reported to compare it? | Modifiers and evidence tags may co-occur and are never called MECE. |\n\n## DOI--key--facet traceability inventory\n\n`abstract` means a nonempty abstract was read from `papers.jsonl`; `title` means\nthe current record has no abstract and therefore licenses only topic-level use.\n\n| DOI | audited key | primary | modifier(s) | evidence tag(s) | provenance |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 10.3390/electrochem2030026 | `raju2021crystal` | P4.2/background | M1 | E1,E3 | abstract |\n| 10.1016/j.jpowsour.2012.09.111 | `shinawi2013stabilization` | P2.1 | M1 | E1 | title |\n| 10.3390/cryst14090795 | `montoya2024lithium` | P2.3 | M2 | E2 | title |\n| 10.1016/j.jpowsour.2014.12.066 | `rosenkiewitz2015nitrogen` | P1.2 | M1 | E1 | title |\n| 10.1021/acs.chemmater.9b04319 | `squires2019native` | P2.3 | M1 | E1 | abstract |\n| 10.1007/s40145-022-0626-y | `zhang2022high` | P3.3 | M1,M4 | E2,E3 | abstract |\n| 10.1016/j.ssi.2021.115640 | `lei2021fabrication` | P3.1 | M1 | E2 | title |\n| 10.1039/d2ta09250f | `schwab2023towards` | P3.1 | M2 | E2,E4 | abstract |\n| 10.1111/jace.18994 | `heywood2023tailoring` | P1.1 | M2 | E1,E2,E4 | abstract |\n| 10.1016/j.jallcom.2016.11.277 | `li2016ga` | P2.1 | M1 | E2 | title |\n| 10.1016/j.jallcom.2022.168380 | `tao2022preparation` | P3.2 | M1 | E2,E3 | title |\n| 10.3390/nano9050721 | `dong2019dual` | P3.2 | M1 | E2,E3 | title |\n| 10.1007/s10854-019-02067-5 | `luo2019influence` | P3.3 | M1,M4 | E2,E3 | title |\n| 10.1016/j.jeurceramsoc.2021.05.041 | `ihrig2021li7la3zr2o12` | P3.2 | — | E2 | title |\n| 10.1088/2053-1591/ab7618 | `xue2020spark` | P3.2 | M1 | E2,E3 | abstract |\n| 10.1016/j.electacta.2016.11.020 | `yamada2016sintering` | P3.2 | — | E2 | title |\n| 10.1021/acsami.5b12186 | `xia2016ionic` | P4.2 | M3 | E2,E3 | abstract |\n| 10.1016/j.ensm.2019.01.018 | `huang2019manipulating` | P3.1 | M2,M3 | E2 | title |\n| 10.1016/j.jpowsour.2014.03.148 | `zhang2014field` | P3.2 | M1 | E2 | title |\n| 10.1111/jace.13455 | `david2015microstructure` | P3.2 | — | E2,E3 | abstract |\n| 10.1021/acsami.0c04850 | `shen2020a` | P3.1 | M3 | E2,E3 | abstract |\n| 10.1016/j.cej.2020.124797 | `zhang2020enhanced` | P3.3 | M4 | E2,E3 | abstract |\n| 10.1039/d0ta11096e | `rosen2021controlling` | P4.2 | M3 | E4 | abstract |\n| 10.1016/j.jeurceramsoc.2020.06.050 | `seo2020broad` | P3.3 | M3 | E2,E3 | abstract |\n| 10.1016/j.jpcs.2019.109080 | `zhang2019effects` | P3.3 | M1,M4 | E2,E3 | abstract |\n| 10.1149/2.1031915jes | `zhang2019densification` | P3.1 | M2,M3,M4 | E2,E3 | abstract |\n| 10.1039/d2ra03303h | `parascos2022compositional` | P2.3 | M1 | E1,E4 | abstract |\n| 10.1016/j.jmat.2018.09.004 | `huang2019searching` | P3.1 | M2,M4 | E2,E3 | abstract |\n| 10.1021/acsami.3c17606 | `zhou2024li5alo4` | P3.3 | M2,M4 | E2,E3 | abstract |\n| 10.20964/2019.10.22 | `lan2019investigation` | P3.1 | M2,M3 | E2 | title |\n| 10.1002/smtd.202300232 | `guo2023uniform` | P3.1 | M3 | E2,E3,E4 | abstract |\n| 10.3390/ma1303056\n\n### workspace/notes/contribution.md 4005\n# Confirmed contribution bundle for the LLZO review\n\n> **Status: CONFIRMED FOR PIPELINE PLANNING (A+B+C).** The confirmation is a\n> host assumption authorized by `docs/competition/LLZO_WRITER_PLAN_TASK.md`\n> because the user requested the final PDF. It permits downstream planning; it\n> is not a claim that the user independently endorsed every scientific wording.\n\n## Evidence boundary\n\nThis is an English, evidence-limited 8--12 page review built from a 46-paper\nstandard-scale diagnostic collection. The collection passed metadata audit, but\nonly 25 records contain abstracts and the local full-text checks were selective.\nIt is **not comprehensive**, and no route, dopant, additive, or sintering method\nwill be ranked as intrinsically superior from title/abstract evidence.\n\n## Motivation\n\nLLZO processing evidence is distributed across precursor selection, powder\nsynthesis, composition and phase control, thermal treatment, densification,\nenvironmental boundary conditions, and structure/transport measurement. Even\nnominally similar materials may differ in precursor homogeneity, lithium\ninventory, dopant content, thermal history, cover powder, crucible, density, and\nconductivity definition. A route-centred list can therefore hide coupled\nvariables, while an uncontrolled performance ranking can mistake incompatible\nmeasurements for a materials trend. This review will separate the process chain,\ncross-cutting modifiers, and evidence needed for comparison.\n\n## Contribution A — process-chain framework with explicit facets\n\nThe review contributes a primary navigation chain:\n\n`powder synthesis -> phase/composition control -> thermal treatment/densification -> structure/transport readout`.\n\nComposition and process-environment variables are attached as cross-cutting\nmodifiers, and comparability/reproducibility is attached as an evidence facet.\nThe complete framework is a **faceted framework, not a single MECE tree**. MECE\nis used only as a local design goal where sibling labels share the same axis.\n\n## Contribution B — minimum comparability record\n\nThe review defines the minimum record required before two LLZO results are\ntreated as directly comparable:\n\n1. nominal and, where available, measured composition and dopant content;\n2. precursor identities, lithium excess, mixing method, and powder route;\n3. calcination and sintering temperature, time, pressure, and heating schedule;\n4. atmosphere, cover/mother powder, crucible, and sintering additive;\n5. phase assemblage, relative density, and grain/grain-boundary descriptors;\n6. conductivity type (total, bulk, or grain boundary), test temperature,\n   electrode configuration, and activation-energy convention;\n7. batch count, spatial sampling, and uncertainty or dispersion.\n\nThe framework supports three outcomes: directly comparable, parallel qualitative\nevidence, or insufficient fields. It does not produce an evidence-free ranking.\n\n## Contribution C — reproducibility and low-temperature-densification problem map\n\nThe review organizes open problems as:\n\n`observed pattern -> evidence/provenance limitation -> falsifiable next action -> audited citation anchors`.\n\nThe problem map distinguishes starting lithium stoichiometry from lithium-loss\ncontrol during firing, separates a low processing temperature from a verified\nlow-temperature densification mechanism, and treats cover powder, crucible,\natmosphere, additive chemistry, batch variability, and measurement definition as\nfirst-class variables. Missing metadata are treated as missing evidence in this\ncollection, never as proof that an experiment has not been performed.\n\n## Deliverable-level claim\n\nTogether, A+B+C turn the current literature set into an auditable map of what\nwas varied, what was measured, and what can legitimately be compared. The review\nwill expose evidence limits and specify tests that could discriminate coupled\nprocessing explanations; it will not claim exhaustive coverage or laboratory\nvalidation of model-ranked precursor routes.\n\n\n### workspace/notes/taxonomy_validation.md 2400\n# Taxonomy mechanical validation (not semantic MECE validation)\n\n- 结果：**PASS — mechanical constraints only**\n- BibTeX 条目数：46\n- 已识别叶节点：19\n- taxonomy 中不同 citation key：46\n- BibTeX 中不存在的 key：无\n- 少于 3 篇支撑的叶节点：无\n- 叶节点内重复 key：无\n\n## 逐叶统计\n\n- P1.1 Solid-state reaction, precursor choice, and mixing：6 个不同 key\n- P1.2 Sol--gel, chelation, and other solution-mediated routes：5 个不同 key\n- P1.3 Coprecipitation, combustion, and rapid powder formation：4 个不同 key\n- P2.1 Li-sublattice substitution and cubic-phase control：6 个不同 key\n- P2.2 Zr-site and multi-element substitution：5 个不同 key\n- P2.3 Stoichiometry, native defects, and phase evolution：6 个不同 key\n- P3.1 Pressureless sintering and temperature--time windows：6 个不同 key\n- P3.2 Pressure-, field-, and ultrafast-assisted densification：7 个不同 key\n- P3.3 Low-temperature and additive-assisted densification：6 个不同 key\n- P4.1 Phase, density, and microstructure readout：7 个不同 key\n- P4.2 Ionic-transport and stability readout：7 个不同 key\n- M1 Dopant identity, site, and coupled composition：9 个不同 key\n- M2 Lithium inventory, volatilization, and replenishment：9 个不同 key\n- M3 Crucible, cover powder, atmosphere, and exposure：7 个不同 key\n- M4 Sintering additives and intergranular reaction products：6 个不同 key\n- E1 Composition and powder-route record：6 个不同 key\n- E2 Thermal-process and densification record：8 个不同 key\n- E3 Structure and transport measurement record：7 个不同 key\n- E4 Replication, uniformity, and scale record：6 个不同 key\n\n## 机械检查命令\n\n`python3 tools/validate_taxonomy.py workspace/notes/taxonomy.md workspace/library/references.bib --min-per-leaf 3 --report /tmp/llzo_taxonomy_validation.md`\n\n退出码为 0。运行时把临时报告写入 `/tmp`，本文件按任务的 `apply_patch`\n编辑约束同步结果。\n\n## 语义边界\n\n该脚本只检查 key 存在性、每叶最少支撑数和叶内重复。它**不**验证完整\n框架是 MECE，也不把题名/摘要归类提升为全文证据。语义修复采用分面设计：\nP1--P4 是主工艺链，M1--M4 是横切修饰面，E1--E4 是可比性/复现性证据面；\n`taxonomy.md` 另列 P1/P2、P3.3/M4、M2/M3 和 modifier/evidence 边界测试。\n\n\n### workspace/state/llzo_writer_plan_validation.md 10984\n# LLZO writer-plan validation\n\n## Verdict\n\n**PASS for manuscript-writer handoff, with declared evidence limitations.** The\nrequired planning artifacts exist and pass the applicable mechanical checks. This\nis not `draft_complete`, `figures_ready`, or `review_pass`: no manuscript was\nwritten, and the remaining reviewer issue I4 belongs to the idea artifact.\n\n## Adopted planning assumption\n\n`docs/competition/LLZO_WRITER_PLAN_TASK.md` authorizes the host to adopt A+B+C\nafter the user requested the final PDF. That assumption is recorded at the top of\n`workspace/notes/contribution.md` and in the ledger. It confirms pipeline planning\nonly; it does not expand the evidence base or make the 46-paper collection\ncomprehensive.\n\n## Required outputs\n\n| Output | Result | Key acceptance evidence |\n|---|---|---|\n| `workspace/notes/contribution.md` | PASS | A+B+C confirmed for planning; motivation and non-comprehensive evidence boundary explicit. |\n| `workspace/notes/taxonomy.md` | PASS | P1--P4 primary chain, M1--M4 modifiers, E1--E4 evidence facet; no single-tree MECE claim; 46-row DOI/key traceability. |\n| `workspace/notes/citation_bank.md` | PASS (adapted threshold) | 46 entries, 46 unique audited keys; abstract/title provenance in every claim. |\n| `workspace/notes/research_gaps.md` | PASS | Six gaps; each has at least two audited keys, provenance, limitation, and falsifiable next action. |\n| `workspace/drafts/blueprint.md` | PASS | English 8--12 page contract, A+B+C coverage, existing process map, and boxed unverified model diagnostic. |\n| `workspace/notes/style_notes.md` | PASS as a supplement | Three-review structural supplement; style bank remains WARN-level rather than being promoted. |\n| `workspace/notes/taxonomy_validation.md` | PASS (mechanical only) | 19 leaves, all at least three keys, no unknown or within-leaf duplicate keys; semantic limits prominent. |\n\n## Input and evidence audit\n\n- `papers.jsonl`: 46 parseable records; 25 contain abstracts and 21 are\n  title-only. Its DOI set matches all 46 BibTeX DOI values.\n- `references.bib`: 46 entries; `workspace/state/CITATION_AUDIT.md` reports 46\n  PASS and zero non-PASS records. The BibTeX was not edited.\n- Search notes: all four current `search_*.md` files were read. Their documented\n  Semantic Scholar 429 errors, local-corpus timeouts/truncation, and 2015--2020\n  visible local-corpus range remain coverage limitations.\n- Style evidence: the existing bank has 15 records but one local full text. A\n  focused supplement inspected the local Cao 2014 PDF, the full Raju 2021\n  publisher PDF, and the full Wang 2024 publisher HTML for organization only.\n- `super_library`: absent at both configured probes; skipped and recorded as a\n  non-blocking style/tooling degradation.\n\n## Deterministic commands and results\n\n### 1. Ledger status at start\n\nCommand:\n\n`python3 tools/loopctl.py status`\n\nResult: round 1, stage `taxonomy`; `taxonomy_ready=PENDING`; open majors I1 and\nI4. This satisfied the mandatory start-of-work ledger check.\n\n### 2. Taxonomy mechanical validation\n\nCommand:\n\n`python3 tools/validate_taxonomy.py workspace/notes/taxonomy.md workspace/library/references.bib --min-per-leaf 3 --report /tmp/llzo_taxonomy_validation.md`\n\nResult: exit 0. The report found 19 leaves, 46 distinct taxonomy keys, no unknown\nBibTeX key, no leaf below three keys, and no duplicate key within a leaf. The\ntemporary report was synchronized to `workspace/notes/taxonomy_validation.md`\nusing `apply_patch` and relabelled as mechanical rather than semantic validation.\n\n### 3. Citation-bank default check\n\nCommand:\n\n`python3 tools/bank_check.py workspace/notes/citation_bank.md workspace/library/references.bib --target-cites 42`\n\nResult: exit 1, intentionally retained as evidence. It reported 46 bank entries,\n46 unique keys, and two blockers: `46 < 42 x 1.5 = 63` candidates and 4% recent\nshare below the default 50% threshold.\n\nThe target of 42 unique references follows the future 90% integration gate:\n`ceil(46 x 0.9) = 42`. The library is capped at 46 in this standard diagnostic run,\nso a 63-candidate unique pool is impossible without expanding the authorized\ncollection. Only `montoya2024lithium` and `zhou2024li5alo4` fall in the checker's\ncurrent three-year window (2024--2026), i.e. 2/46 = 4.35%.\n\nThe required decision was logged before thresholds were adapted:\n\n`python3 tools/loopctl.py log --stage taxonomy --agent survey-writer --event decision --detail \"A+B+C host-confirmed per LLZO_WRITER_PLAN_TASK; bank_check default FAIL retained: 46 candidates < 42x1.5=63 and only 2/46 keys are 2024-2026. Standard diagnostic library is capped at 46 and not comprehensive; adapt bank check to min-ratio=1.0 and min-recent=0.04 without adding or fabricating references; manuscript still targets >=42/46 unique-key integration.\"`\n\n### 4. Citation-bank adapted check\n\nCommand:\n\n`python3 tools/bank_check.py workspace/notes/citation_bank.md workspace/library/references.bib --target-cites 42 --min-ratio 1.0 --min-recent 0.04`\n\nResult: exit 0, PASS; 46 entries, 46 unique keys, 4% displayed recent share. The\nadapted thresholds acknowledge the fixed library ceiling and observed recent-key\nfloor. They do **not** demonstrate recent-literature adequacy or comprehensive\ncoverage.\n\n### 5. Cross-file structural assertions\n\nCommand class: a read-only inline Python assertion audit over\n`papers.jsonl`, `references.bib`, the five writer outputs, and the three process-\nmap source/delivery files.\n\nResult: exit 0. Assertions verified:\n\n- Bib/paper DOI sets match at 46/46; abstract/title-only split is 25/21;\n- citation bank has 46 entries, 46 unique keys, and exact Bib-key coverage;\n- taxonomy traceability has 46 DOI--key rows matching the BibTeX DOI map;\n- six research gaps each contain at least two audited anchors and all four\n  required blocks (anchors, provenance, evidence limitation, falsifiable action);\n- blueprint contains the English 8--12 page contract, A+B+C, existing SVG path,\n  and the `CHEMICAL ROUTES UNVERIFIED — NOT FOR LAB USE` box;\n- all edited Markdown files have no trailing whitespace.\n\n### 6. Existing process-map syntax and topology check\n\nCommand class: Python `json.loads` for the figspec and\n`xml.etree.ElementTree.parse` for SVG/drawio, followed by edge-endpoint assertions.\n\nResult: exit 0. The figspec JSON and both XML files parse; all six edges point to\nexisting node IDs; SVG, drawio, and figspec are nonempty. The figure was not\nchanged or re-rendered in this writer-planning task.\n\n### 7. Ledger repair and gate actions\n\nCommands:\n\n`python3 tools/loopctl.py issue close --id I1 --note \"Refactored taxonomy into primary P1-P4 process chain plus cross-cutting M1-M4 modifier and E1-E4 evidence facets; removed single-tree MECE claim, added ambiguity boundary tests and 46-row DOI-key-facet traceability; mechanical report explicitly disclaims semantic MECE validation.\"`\n\n`python3 tools/loopctl.py gate --name taxonomy_ready --status PASS --detail \"Host-confirmed A+B+C per LLZO_WRITER_PLAN_TASK; faceted taxonomy mechanically PASS (19 leaves, 46 audited keys); standard 46-paper collection remains non-comprehensive and mainly title/abstract-level.\" --inputs workspace/notes/contribution.md,workspace/notes/taxonomy.md,workspace/notes/taxonomy_validation.md`\n\nResult: I1 closed; `taxonomy_ready=PASS` with input fingerprints. I4 remains the\nonly open major and still targets `ideas`.\n\n## Checks not applicable in this task\n\n- `bib_guard.py workspace/drafts/sections ...` was not run because the task\n  explicitly forbids manuscript writing and no section `.tex` files were created.\n- `tex_guard.py workspace/drafts` and LaTeX compilation were not run because\n  there is no assembled manuscript.\n- The figure renderer was not rerun because no figure source was edited; existing\n  source/delivery syntax and topology were checked read-only.\n- No bibliography entry was added, deleted, or edited.\n\n## Limitations and unresolved issue\n\n1. The 46-paper collection is standard-scale, not comprehensive. Coverage is a\n   title/abstract keyword diagnostic, not a systematic-search completeness claim.\n2. Metadata integrity PASS does not validate claim context. Title-only bank\n   entries remain weak until full text is checked; even abstract-level `strong`\n   means directly stated in the stored abstract, not manuscript-ready proof.\n3. The recent-key ratio is only 2/46 for 2024--2026. The adapted bank PASS records\n   a collection ceiling, not a successful freshness target.\n4. The three-review style supplement is not a representative style corpus;\n   `style_bank_ready` properly remains WARN.\n5. Reviewer issue I4 remains open. The blueprint resolves its local presentation\n   by labelling the model output strictly as an infrastructure demonstration with\n   unverified chemistry and no conditions, but the underlying idea artifacts\n   still require their own routed evidence/safety resolution.\n\n## Exact manuscript-writer handoff\n\n1. Read, in order:\n   `workspace/notes/contribution.md`, `workspace/notes/taxonomy.md`,\n   `workspace/notes/citation_bank.md`, `workspace/notes/research_gaps.md`,\n   `workspace/notes/style_notes.md`, and `workspace/drafts/blueprint.md`.\n2. Obtain and inspect full text before promoting any bank entry to a factual\n   manuscript claim. Record claim-level provenance; title-only keys may not carry\n   numerical, comparative, or mechanistic assertions.\n3. Draft English LaTeX sections under `workspace/drafts/sections/` according to\n   the blueprint. Use only audited bank keys. If all 46 BibTeX entries remain,\n   integrate at least 42 defensibly; route unusable keys to `lit_search`/\n   `ref_guard` for evaluation rather than citing them decoratively.\n4. Include `workspace/figures/svg/llzo_process_map.svg` as Figure 1 and retain\n   `workspace/figures/drawio/llzo_process_map.drawio` plus\n   `workspace/figures/figspec/llzo_process_map.json` as editable provenance. The\n   caption must say the map encodes process order and boundary checks, not proven\n   causality.\n5. Render the model diagnostic as a visible boxed item with both headings:\n   `MODEL-ASSISTED PRECURSOR DIAGNOSTIC — INFRASTRUCTURE DEMONSTRATION ONLY` and\n   `CHEMICAL ROUTES UNVERIFIED — NOT FOR LAB USE`. Keep `conditions=null`, omit\n   model scores and lab conditions, and do not claim novelty or chemical validity.\n6. Preserve I4 as open until the idea artifacts receive routed review; manuscript\n   wording alone does not close it.\n7. After section drafting, run exactly:\n\n   `python3 tools/bib_guard.py workspace/drafts/sections workspace/library/references.bib --min-integration 0.9 --min-cites-per-1k 8`\n\n8. After assembly with `templates/survey_main.tex`, run exactly:\n\n   `python3 tools/tex_guard.py workspace/drafts`\n\n9. Compile with XeLaTeX if Unicode requires it, document remaining warnings in\n   `workspace/drafts/revision_log.md`, and do not set `draft_complete` until all\n   blocking checks pass and an independent reviewer has inspected the manuscript.\n\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
